WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.840
In this video, we'll cover one, actions Amazon takes to address restricted

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:13.000
products policy violations, two, addressing restricted products policy

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.000
violations, and three, best practices to remain compliant.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Note that this module

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.520
was developed specifically for sellers operating in the US and provides an

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.366
overview of US policies.

00:00:25.366 --> 00:00:28.135
Policies in other countries would vary.

00:00:28.135 --> 00:00:29.520
Refer to the

00:00:29.520 --> 00:00:34.265
restricted products help pages in your local seller central account.

00:00:34.265 --> 00:00:34.740
Restricted

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:39.520
products policies are put in place to protect Amazon's customers from products

00:00:39.520 --> 00:00:45.360
that are illegal, illegally marketed, unsafe, offensive, or prohibited by Amazon's

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:45.860
policies.

00:00:45.860 --> 00:00:50.360
These policies also give customers confidence that all products

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:55.040
available for purchase in the Amazon store are compliant with local laws and

00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:55.570
regulations.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:01:00.870
Further, within the US there could be state-specific guidelines.

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:01.400
For

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.680
example, some products are subject to additional regulation in the state of

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:06.074
California.

00:01:06.074 --> 00:01:10.800
Make sure to check that your listings comply with all policies for

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:13.067
each country where you sell.

00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:16.240
Let's first review actions Amazon takes against

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.569
restricted product policy violations.

00:01:18.569 --> 00:01:21.480
Amazon constantly works with regulators,

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:26.840
third-party experts, and selling partners to improve and innovate on behalf of

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:31.360
customers and ensure that any listings that violate applicable laws or

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:37.060
regulations or Amazon's restricted product policies are dealt with seriously.

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:38.200
If any

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:42.760
listing is in violation with Amazon's policies we will take corrective action

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:47.120
as appropriate which may include immediately removing the listing from

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:52.240
your catalog, suspending or terminating your selling privileges, destroying

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:56.960
inventory in our fulfillment centers without reimbursement, returning

00:01:56.960 --> 00:02:01.720
inventory, terminating the business relationship and permanent withholding

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:02.545
of payments.

00:02:02.545 --> 00:02:07.080
Further, the sale of any illegal or unsafe products could result

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:08.091
in legal action.

00:02:08.091 --> 00:02:11.800
Please ensure that all of your listings are compliant with these

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:14.357
policies and local laws and regulations.

00:02:14.357 --> 00:02:17.340
Please also note that Amazon updates our

00:02:17.340 --> 00:02:22.440
restricted products policies and help pages to reflect continuously changing

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.622
laws and regulations.

00:02:23.622 --> 00:02:27.560
We attempt to notify our selling partners in advance of

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:32.480
these changes via email and when applicable via the Seller Central News

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:34.768
widget, newsletter, and forums.

00:02:34.768 --> 00:02:38.200
When possible, we proactively notify selling

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:42.120
partners with clear expectations of the time period to sell through their

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:44.945
inventory before removing the detail pages.

00:02:44.945 --> 00:02:48.240
In some cases, Amazon needs to take

00:02:48.240 --> 00:02:52.843
immediate action and our help pages are updated with revised policies.

00:02:52.843 --> 00:02:53.680
Hence, it

00:02:53.680 --> 00:02:58.600
is always a good practice to frequently review the policy pages relevant to

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:02.226
your products to ensure that you are in compliance.

00:03:02.226 --> 00:03:04.240
If you discover listings that

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:09.811
are in violation with our policies or applicable laws, you can contact us.

00:03:09.811 --> 00:03:10.240
Please

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:14.720
visit the category, product, and listing restrictions help page to find more

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:19.277
information and relevant links on how you can report a violation.

00:03:19.277 --> 00:03:20.520
Based on the

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:24.760
type of violation, you may need to provide information to facilitate an

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:25.094
investigation.

00:03:25.094 --> 00:03:29.440
This may include the store or business name of the seller you are

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:35.040
reporting, the ASIN, relevant marketplaces where the violation is taking place, an

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:40.404
explanation detailing the violation and any other supporting documentation.

00:03:40.404 --> 00:03:41.000
You

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:45.738
will also be required to provide your email and contact number.

00:03:45.738 --> 00:03:46.600
Next, let's

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:51.068
review how to respond to a restricted products policy violation notice.

00:03:51.068 --> 00:03:51.880
If you

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:56.600
receive a notification that your ASIN or product was removed due to a

00:03:56.600 --> 00:04:01.440
restricted products violation, please read the full performance notification and

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:06.720
check the policy help pages to understand why your ASIN or product might have been

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:07.080
removed.

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.760
Depending on the nature of the notice, you can take several actions to

00:04:11.760 --> 00:04:16.451
review, resolve, and reduce your future risk of account deactivation.

00:04:16.451 --> 00:04:16.920
The

00:04:16.920 --> 00:04:21.440
performance notifications page can be found under the performance tab in the

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:23.077
seller central main menu.

00:04:23.077 --> 00:04:26.760
This page shows many of the account deactivation and

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:29.760
listing level violation enforcements and messaging.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.760
Selling partners could also

00:04:31.760 --> 00:04:35.083
receive notifications via other channels such as email.

00:04:35.083 --> 00:04:37.160
If you believe that your

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:41.720
product or ASIN was removed in error, you may appeal using the account health

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:42.089
dashboard.

00:04:42.089 --> 00:04:46.880
To do this, hover over the performance tab in the seller central main

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.142
menu, then select account health.

00:04:49.142 --> 00:04:52.760
Removed ASINs can be reviewed and appealed under

00:04:52.760 --> 00:04:54.476
product policy compliance.

00:04:54.476 --> 00:04:58.480
Before you contact seller support, please ensure

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:02.000
that you have followed all the instructions in your restricted products

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:06.840
performance notification and have provided all of the documentation and/or

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:07.808
evidence requested.

00:05:07.808 --> 00:05:11.680
Make sure to respond to individual ASIN level

00:05:11.680 --> 00:05:16.413
violations in a timely manner to help prevent account deactivation.

00:05:16.413 --> 00:05:17.360
To access

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:22.480
more details on this topic, visit the additional information and resources for

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:25.893
sellers about our restricted products policy help page.

00:05:25.893 --> 00:05:27.600
Here are some helpful

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:32.000
tips for selling partners to ensure that they remain compliant with local laws

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.246
and Amazon policies.

00:05:33.246 --> 00:05:37.400
Keep product pages about the product and ensure that the

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.432
detail pages are accurate.

00:05:39.432 --> 00:05:42.480
Carefully review our restricted products policy

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:47.640
help pages and your product catalog on a regular basis to ensure that your

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:49.176
products are compliant.

00:05:49.176 --> 00:05:52.760
Don't forget about products included in inventory

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:56.646
feeds or those that are uploaded using an automated system.

00:05:56.646 --> 00:05:58.200
Check the news widget

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:01.498
and seller forums periodically for any notified changes.

00:06:01.498 --> 00:06:03.560
Also make sure to check

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:08.000
your messages under performance notifications for any specific policy

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:08.680
related changes.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:12.760
A product may still not be permitted even if it is not

00:06:12.760 --> 00:06:17.407
expressly listed on our restricted products policy help page.

00:06:17.407 --> 00:06:18.440
Assign someone

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:23.194
to carefully review each product you are listing to ensure it is compliant.

00:06:23.194 --> 00:06:23.560
When

00:06:23.560 --> 00:06:28.440
buying inventory from another source apart from the manufacturer, make sure to

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:32.880
understand the sourcing and origin of the product and take care to understand the

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:37.686
legal framework in which the product or products may be sold.

00:06:37.686 --> 00:06:38.560
If selling

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:43.120
supplements or eligible drugs confirm that the ingredients are compliant not

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:47.853
just with our policies but with FDA regulations and guidelines.

00:06:47.853 --> 00:06:48.800
The FDA

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:54.480
orange book on prescription and OTC drugs and the FDA green book on animal

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:56.080
drugs are helpful sources.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:00.080
Make sure to also check the list of recalls, market

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:03.547
withdrawals and safety alerts on the FDA website.

00:07:03.547 --> 00:07:05.280
Sellers participating in the

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:10.880
fulfillment by Amazon or FBA program should comply with additional FBA specific

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:16.160
product restrictions in addition to Amazon's restricted products policies.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:20.720
These include hazardous materials and substances regulated by the Narcotics

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:21.160
Act.

00:07:21.160 --> 00:07:26.000
For instance the sale of vehicle tires and alcoholic beverages are

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:31.217
prohibited for sale by FBA.
